 ```
 
+### Downloads
+`GET /api/mods/:mod_id/download/:version` and `GET /api/mods/slug/:userSlug/:mod_slug/download/:version`
+record the download (`ModDownload` with the client IP from `?ip=`, `CF-Connecting-IP` or the first
+`X-Forwarded-For` hop) and answer `302 Found` with `Location: <R2_PUBLIC_BASE_URL>/<key>`, where each
+`/`-separated segment of the key is encoded with `encodeURIComponent`. Unknown versions answer `404`;
+files whose stored URL is not on the R2 domain answer `410 Gone`.
+
 To setup the project run:
 
 ```bash
